=== VGA typed ===
OSB - Operating System Basic
Bootable kernel prototype (C# / NativeAOT, bare metal)
Keyboard: PS/2 IRQ1 + serial console IRQ4 (COM1).
Timer: PIT channel 0 @ 100 Hz (IRQ0 ticks).
Clock: RTC via IRQ8 (update-ended).
Scheduler: preemptive round-robin over a task table.
Processes: private address space per process (CR3).
Ring 3: user segments + TSS; syscalls via INT 21h (DOS-style).
Files: ATA PIO + ext4 on A:.
Shell: boot program (default A:\OSB\BIN\SHELL.EXE; CONF/BOOT only in WITH_TESTS
builds)
Mouse: PS/2 IRQ12 (stream mode).

login: root

root@OSB A:\OSB\ROOT>aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa








